@startuml
title Pay for an order
actor Shopper as S
participant "Orders API" as API
database "Orders DB" as DB
queue Events
S -> API : POST /orders
activate API
API -> DB : insert order
DB --> API : order id
alt card accepted
  API ->> Events : order paid
else card declined
  API --> S : 402
end
loop retries
  API -> DB : update status
end
note over API, DB : All writes are in one transaction
== Later ==
API -> Events
return 201 Created
@enduml
